                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Genuinely extremely fun. Plus infinite content since you can just put in \"most\" images you have or find on the web. Certain images may not load in game and I still don't have an exact answer as to why but If I had to guess it would be wonky dimensions or format issues. One more thing, this game doesnt cache a thumbnail so scrolling through a bunch of images takes a long time due to having to load each image on each page. Since it doesnt cache ever you will have to reload it multiple times if you keep scrolling up and down. I wish the devs would fix that little irritation but considering there hasn't been a post since May 30 2020, it's very unlikely to happen. \r\n\r\n*TLDR: Great game with endless custom content, minor issues",
